  "content": {
    "equation": "Bolus:\nBolus = (180 * Weight) / Bolus Conc.\n• Bolus is calculated in mL\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Bolus Conc. is input in mg/mL\nInfuse Rate:\nWhen CrCl is ≥50 mL/min:\nInfuse Rate = [(2 * Weight * 60) / 1000] / Infusion Conc.\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• CrCl is input in mL/min\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Infusion Conc. is input in mg/mL\nWhen CrCl is <50 mL/min:\nInfuse Rate = [(Weight * 60) / 1000] / Infusion Conc.\n• Infuse Rate is calculated in mL/hr\n• CrCl is input in mL/min\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Infusion Conc. is input in mg/mL",
